From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tdh: reading and formatting the properties of an event (3747)

tdh: reading and formatting the properties of an event

TdhGetPropertySize and TdhGetProperty locate properties in the payload from
the manifest (fixed and variable sizes, counts and lengths from earlier
properties, array elements), TdhFormatProperty turns a value into text with
value and bit maps, TdhGetEventMapInformation returns the maps of the manifest
and TdhEnumerateManifestProviderEvents lists the events of a provider.
---
